From: iceland <iceland@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 05:20:07 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 03/30] gpu: iceland gvm: scanout copy source selection (ctx0 /
 dmabuf / guest backing) and frame dump

The ctx0 transfer_read of a virgl scanout read back a black frame on the
Pad 4 (GLES 3.2 host). CROSVM_GVM_SCANOUT_READ=auto|ctx0|dmabuf|backing
picks the source (auto: first non-black, remembered per resource);
CROSVM_GVM_DUMP_FRAME=<dir> logs GVM-FRAME statistics of every source
every 5 s (max 5) and writes the shown frame as PPM.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
